# Slog — environment variables
#
# Runtime: NONE REQUIRED.
# The app uses no external APIs and no secrets. It runs entirely on Reddit's
# Devvit platform: webview + server endpoints + Redis + scheduler + Reddit API.
# All identity/auth is provided by Devvit's server middleware at request time.
#
# Local development authenticates via the Devvit CLI:
#   npx devvit login        # opens a browser flow; token stored at ~/.devvit/token
#   npx devvit whoami       # verify the logged-in account
# Keep ~/.devvit/token outside this repository (it is gitignored via .devvit/).
#
# Optional local flags (unset by default):
# SLOG_DEBUG_FLOOR=      # pin a specific floor id for local debugging
